       {"name": "Single-leg stance / reactive balance hold", "sets": 3, "reps": "20-30s holds", "cue": "Stand tall on one leg, keep hips level, add small wobbles only once steady", "rationale": "A dissertation found no correlation between glute strength and pelvic-drop magnitude — points to a motor-control deficit, not just weakness.", "sourceCitation": "Burnet EN, VCU dissertation, scholarscompass.vcu.edu/etd/1212"}
