       {"name": "Single-leg bridge (maintenance)", "sets": 3, "reps": "10-15/side", "cue": "Keep form standards from Phase 2 — this is upkeep, not a new challenge", "rationale": "Maintenance dosing to protect the gains made in Phase 2.", "sourceCitation": "Lashien et al. 2024"}
     ],
     "advanceCriteria": "Running volume back to baseline with no symptom recurrence over 2+ consecutive weeks. Re-film and re-check the pelvic_drop measurement against where you started."
